IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`

-- Delaware General Corporation Law, 8 Del. C. ch. 1, Subchapter XIV (ss 341-349): CLOSE CORPORATIONS -- what a close
-- corporation is, how it is formed, kept and lost, and what happens to stock issued or transferred in breach of
-- its qualifying conditions. Layer 1: the law, objectively, from the text alone (src:1680-1740).
-- (ss 350-356 are in dg10-close-governance.l4.)
--
-- The source is the plain-text rendering de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt; it is not the official text.
-- Quote lines are slices of it: `-- src:N | ...` is line N, and an ellipsis means the line goes on.
--
-- Subchapter XIV is outside the stockholder-to-member reading of s 114(a) for a nonstock corporation (s 114(b)(3)):
-- these sections speak of stock corporations. A close corporation is "a corporation organized under this chapter"
-- (s 342(a)); whether it is a stock corporation is left to the sections (they all speak of stock).
--
-- SEAT: a person who incorporates, directs or holds stock in a Delaware corporation: here, an incorporator of a
-- close corporation, its director, or a stockholder (including a minority stockholder) or a transferee of its stock.

§ `Subchapter XIV. Close Corporations; Special Provisions`

§§ `s 341 Law applicable to close corporation`

-- src:1683 | (a) This subchapter applies to all close corporations, as defined in § 342 of this title. Unless a corporation elects to become a close corporation under this subchapter in the manner prescribed in this subchapter, it shall be subject in all respects to this chapter, except this subchapter.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 341(a) (src:1683)
DECLARE `s 341(a) Law that governs a corporation` IS ONE OF
    `this chapter, including this subchapter, under s 341(a)`
    `this chapter, except this subchapter, under s 341(a)`

-- A close corporation is as defined in s 342; one that has not elected under the subchapter is subject to the chapter
-- except the subchapter.
-- src:1683 | (a) This subchapter applies to all close corporations, as defined in § 342 of this title. Unless a corporation elects to become a close corporation under this subchapter in the manner prescribed in this subchapter, it shall be subject in all respects to this chapter, except this subchapter.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 341(a) (src:1683)
GIVEN `the corporation is a close corporation as defined in s 342` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 341(a) Law that governs a corporation`
`s 341(a) the law that governs the corporation` `the corporation is a close corporation as defined in s 342` MEANS
    IF `the corporation is a close corporation as defined in s 342`
    THEN `this chapter, including this subchapter, under s 341(a)`
    ELSE `this chapter, except this subchapter, under s 341(a)`

-- "This chapter shall be applicable to all close corporations ... except insofar as this subchapter otherwise
-- provides." A corporation that is not a close corporation is outside the subsection: not covered.
-- src:1684 | (b) This chapter shall be applicable to all close corporations, as defined in § 342 of this title, except insofar as this subchapter otherwise provides.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 341(b) (src:1684)
GIVEN `the corporation is a close corporation as defined in s 342` IS A BOOLEAN
      `this subchapter otherwise provides on the point` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 341(b) this chapter is applicable to the close corporation on the point` `the corporation is a close corporation as defined in s 342` `this subchapter otherwise provides on the point` MEANS
    IF `the corporation is a close corporation as defined in s 342`
    THEN JUST (NOT `this subchapter otherwise provides on the point`)
    ELSE NOTHING

§§ `s 342 Close corporation defined; contents of certificate of incorporation`

-- src:1688 | (a) A close corporation is a corporation organized under this chapter whose certificate of incorporation contains the provisions required by § 102 of this title and, in addition, provides that:
-- src:1689 | (1) All of the corporation’s issued stock of all classes, exclusive of treasury shares, shall be represented by certificates and shall be held of record by not more than a specified number of persons, not exceeding 30; and
-- src:1690 | (2) All of the issued stock of all classes shall be subject to 1 or more of the restrictions on transfer permitted by § 202 of this title; and
-- src:1691 | (3) The corporation shall make no offering of any of its stock of any class which would constitute a “public offering” within the meaning of the United States Securities Act of 1933 [15 U.S.C. § 77a et seq.] as it may be amended from time to time.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 342(a) (src:1688-1691)
DECLARE `s 342(a) Certificate of incorporation of a corporation` HAS
    `the corporation is organized under this chapter`                                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certificate contains the provisions required by s 102`                                           IS A BOOLEAN  -- out of range: section 102 (piece dg1)
    `the certificate provides that all the issued stock of all classes, exclusive of treasury shares, is represented by certificates` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certificate provides that the issued stock is held of record by not more than a specified number of persons` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of persons the certificate specifies`                                                     IS A NUMBER
    `the certificate provides that all the issued stock of all classes is subject to 1 or more of the restrictions on transfer permitted by s 202` IS A BOOLEAN  -- out of range: section 202 (piece dg3)
    `the certificate provides that the corporation will make no offering of its stock that would constitute a public offering within the meaning of the Securities Act of 1933` IS A BOOLEAN  -- the Securities Act of 1933 is not among the inputs

-- (1): certificated stock, held of record by not more than a specified number of persons, not exceeding 30.
-- fork F8: the specified number must be a number not exceeding 30; "not more than a specified number" is then the
-- cap on holders of record.
-- src:1689 | (1) All of the corporation’s issued stock of all classes, exclusive of treasury shares, shall be represented by certificates and shall be held of record by not more than a specified number of persons, not exceeding 30; and
@ref 8 Del. C. § 342(a)(1) (src:1689)
GIVEN certificate IS A `s 342(a) Certificate of incorporation of a corporation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 342(a)(1) the certificate provides for certificated stock held of record by a specified number of persons not exceeding 30` certificate MEANS
        certificate's `the certificate provides that all the issued stock of all classes, exclusive of treasury shares, is represented by certificates`
    AND certificate's `the certificate provides that the issued stock is held of record by not more than a specified number of persons`
    AND certificate's `the number of persons the certificate specifies` AT MOST 30

-- src:1690 | (2) All of the issued stock of all classes shall be subject to 1 or more of the restrictions on transfer permitted by § 202 of this title; and
@ref 8 Del. C. § 342(a)(2) (src:1690)
GIVEN certificate IS A `s 342(a) Certificate of incorporation of a corporation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 342(a)(2) the certificate subjects all the issued stock to restrictions on transfer permitted by s 202` certificate MEANS
    certificate's `the certificate provides that all the issued stock of all classes is subject to 1 or more of the restrictions on transfer permitted by s 202`

-- src:1691 | (3) The corporation shall make no offering of any of its stock of any class which would constitute a “public offering” within the meaning of the United States Securities Act of 1933 [15 U.S.C. § 77a et seq.] as it may be amended from time to time.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 342(a)(3) (src:1691)
GIVEN certificate IS A `s 342(a) Certificate of incorporation of a corporation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 342(a)(3) the certificate provides for no public offering of the stock` certificate MEANS
    certificate's `the certificate provides that the corporation will make no offering of its stock that would constitute a public offering within the meaning of the Securities Act of 1933`

-- src:1688 | (a) A close corporation is a corporation organized under this chapter whose certificate of incorporation contains the provisions required by § 102 of this title and, in addition, provides that:
@ref 8 Del. C. § 342(a) (src:1688-1691)
GIVEN certificate IS A `s 342(a) Certificate of incorporation of a corporation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 342(a) the certificate contains the provisions of paragraphs (1) to (3)` certificate MEANS
        `s 342(a)(1) the certificate provides for certificated stock held of record by a specified number of persons not exceeding 30` certificate
    AND `s 342(a)(2) the certificate subjects all the issued stock to restrictions on transfer permitted by s 202` certificate
