    `s 342(a) the certificate contains the provisions of paragraphs (1) to (3)` certificate

-- src:1697 | A close corporation shall be formed in accordance with §§ 101, 102 and 103 of this title, except that:
@ref 8 Del. C. § 343 (src:1697)
GIVEN `the corporation is formed in accordance with ss 101, 102 and 103` IS A BOOLEAN  -- out of range: sections 101, 102 and 103 (piece dg1)
