      certificate IS A `s 342(a) Certificate of incorporation of a corporation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 343 the close corporation is formed` `the corporation is formed in accordance with ss 101, 102 and 103` `the certificate of incorporation contains a heading stating the name of the corporation and that it is a close corporation` certificate MEANS
